\title{Hodgkin–Huxley}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{The planar models of \ref{fnip-0002} and \ref{fnip-0026} come from
a four-dimensional conductance-based model. The question is when
a planar model stays with the trajectories of that model.}

\p{How does a resting membrane become a spiking one?}

